{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Plant. Harvest. Expand. Thrive!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build the garden of your dreams in this relaxing co-op farming game. Whether you're playing solo or teaming up with friends, there's always something to grow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start small with just a few seeds and tools. Plant crops, water them, and watch them grow. Harvest your produce and sell it for coins to upgrade your tools, unlock new plants, and expand your plot into a flourishing garden paradise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PLANT &amp; GROW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838600/extras/Product_Gif_01-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1751174488\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Grow Crops</strong> \u2013 Plant a wide variety of vegetables, fruits, and flowers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83c\udf3e <strong>Work Together</strong> \u2013 Join up to 6 players in online co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uded2 <strong>Sell to Upgrade</strong> \u2013 Sell your harvest to buy tools, seeds, and garden expansions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfe1 <strong>Customize Your Garden</strong> \u2013 Decorate and arrange your garden just how you like it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd52 <strong>Day/Night Cycle</strong> \u2013 Enjoy a relaxing, dynamic world that changes as you play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838600/extras/product_gif_02-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif